(7577693, 1218018, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the bold hues of oranges that pop off the black in this tunnel! Great light as the orange seems to glow. My eye travels along the pathway to discover another who ''walks'' this path of unique beauty. Well composed, great details, and fantastic lighting - wonderful work!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the bold hues of oranges that pop off the black in this tunnel! Great light as the orange seems to glow. My eye travels along the pathway to discover another who ''walks'' this path of unique beauty. Well composed, great details, and fantastic lighting - wonderful work!', '2018-07-05 21:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577695, 1217952, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Oh my gosh! Now that is an upload that is not kidding around...really this is a fantastic idea and very well put together! Love how the boy''s hand and face are pressed against the screen for it really conveys that he is actually there. And for just a touch of whimsy there is the yellow vase off to the side with red feathery things that make me think of the trufflia trees from the Dr. Seuss story, The Lorax.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Oh my gosh! Now that is an upload that is not kidding around...really this is a fantastic idea and very well put together! Love how the boy''s hand and face are pressed against the screen for it really conveys that he is actually there. And for just a touch of whimsy there is the yellow vase off to the side with red feathery things that make me think of the trufflia trees from the Dr. Seuss story, The Lorax.', '2018-07-05 21:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577698, 1217953, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Lighting, composition, and details are fantastic in this shot! My eye travels all along the lines and angles in this building with such unique architectural features especially in the top floor and ceiling. This inside space is an exploration of shapes that the eye can travel up and down on. The inclusion of people is an added bonus for it gives one a sense of scale of this space.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Lighting, composition, and details are fantastic in this shot! My eye travels all along the lines and angles in this building with such unique architectural features especially in the top floor and ceiling. This inside space is an exploration of shapes that the eye can travel up and down on. The inclusion of people is an added bonus for it gives one a sense of scale of this space.', '2018-07-05 21:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577702, 1217339, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I am not sure if it is books or movies that line the shelves but one thing is for certain there are a great many of them! What a unique and interesting place to take a stroll! I would love to know the story of this place. I love the wavy shapes of the ''center'' shelves. This indoor ''maze'' would not be complete without someone or two venturing through and navigating this indoor space. Great find and good eye in composing this photo - wonderfully captured.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I am not sure if it is books or movies that line the shelves but one thing is for certain there are a great many of them! What a unique and interesting place to take a stroll! I would love to know the story of this place. I love the wavy shapes of the ''center'' shelves. This indoor ''maze'' would not be complete without someone or two venturing through and navigating this indoor space. Great find and good eye in composing this photo - wonderfully captured.', '2018-07-05 21:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577703, 1216690, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I really like the composition that places the viewer directly inside the picture. It feels like I am in the rabbit hole looking up and out at what is directly above me. Three clock faces look down into the hole staring at me, not quite giving me the time of day or being much help;-) I love this whimsical and colorful fun photo that places the viewer directly inside the world of Wonderland.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I really like the composition that places the viewer directly inside the picture. It feels like I am in the rabbit hole looking up and out at what is directly above me. Three clock faces look down into the hole staring at me, not quite giving me the time of day or being much help;-) I love this whimsical and colorful fun photo that places the viewer directly inside the world of Wonderland.', '2018-07-05 21:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
