(7577867, 1217659, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the overhead view the allows one to peer inside the piano! Love the light and details that showcase all the internal parts of this instrument. It is very much a study of shapes and patterns as one explores this musical composition.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the overhead view the allows one to peer inside the piano! Love the light and details that showcase all the internal parts of this instrument. It is very much a study of shapes and patterns as one explores this musical composition.', '2018-07-06 11:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577868, 1217557, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The overhead view allows me to take a peek into the car. And what unexpected sight do I discover there? An adorable, little dog is curled up comfortably on the passenger side seat! It must be a very comfortable seat indeed. Love the composition. The B&amp;W tones and contrasts are wonderfully dynamic - great job!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The overhead view allows me to take a peek into the car. And what unexpected sight do I discover there? An adorable, little dog is curled up comfortably on the passenger side seat! It must be a very comfortable seat indeed. Love the composition. The B&W tones and contrasts are wonderfully dynamic - great job!', '2018-07-06 11:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577870, 1217659, 156466, '<td valign="top">Really like it but a little to low pass filtery for me. It''s a nice subtle edit but loses too much in the shadows.</td>', 'Really like it but a little to low pass filtery for me. It''s a nice subtle edit but loses too much in the shadows.', '2018-07-06 11:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
