(7577935, 1217448, 16106, '<td valign="top">A bautiful composition, but I miss something that hints at what we are inside of. I know it is a barn, but some hint of timbers or hay bales would have helped it as a challenge entry, even though it might hurt it as an image.</td>', 'A bautiful composition, but I miss something that hints at what we are inside of. I know it is a barn, but some hint of timbers or hay bales would have helped it as a challenge entry, even though it might hurt it as an image.', '2018-07-06 15:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
