(7577946, 1218034, 156466, '<td valign="top">Spring Valley Christian Church just north of Blairstown, if I''m not mistaken. Love that place but have yet to take a photo there that I''m happy with. Light is incredibly difficult unless you have a perfectly hazy day. One of these days I''m going to dare the mosquitoes and shoot it at night - do some light painting.</td>', 'Spring Valley Christian Church just north of Blairstown, if I''m not mistaken. Love that place but have yet to take a photo there that I''m happy with. Light is incredibly difficult unless you have a perfectly hazy day. One of these days I''m going to dare the mosquitoes and shoot it at night - do some light painting.', '2018-07-06 16:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
