(7578471, 1218006, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Awesome view from inside a surfboard shack! Love the play on words with the title. Visually it is not a boring place at all - plenty to look at and plenty of selection for any surfer. Love the composition - you have the two rows of surfboards and there is one front and center that looks like it is getting buffed and cleaned. An interesting place to take a stroll and an excellent place for a photo opp!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Awesome view from inside a surfboard shack! Love the play on words with the title. Visually it is not a boring place at all - plenty to look at and plenty of selection for any surfer. Love the composition - you have the two rows of surfboards and there is one front and center that looks like it is getting buffed and cleaned. An interesting place to take a stroll and an excellent place for a photo opp!', '2018-07-07 23:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578735, 1217997, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Very much meets the challenge and rather disturbing given the subject matter is human slavery. That aside - the viewer is given and ''inside'' look at the horror of being imprisoned. No freedom, we are boxed in. One hand reaches out to be free - reaching for the light that comes from three holes in the side panel. Darkness and light are features in this composition. The B&amp;W is perfect for this photo because it highlights the play of light and dark both in theme and tone. Great lighting and details too.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Very much meets the challenge and rather disturbing given the subject matter is human slavery. That aside - the viewer is given and ''inside'' look at the horror of being imprisoned. No freedom, we are boxed in. One hand reaches out to be free - reaching for the light that comes from three holes in the side panel. Darkness and light are features in this composition. The B&W is perfect for this photo because it highlights the play of light and dark both in theme and tone. Great lighting and details too.', '2018-07-08 12:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578744, 1217926, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the lighting that puts the spotlight on revisiting memories by rediscovering things packed away in an old trunk. Unpacking memories is the idea that is strongly projected. There are vintage antique items that are perfectly arranged/placed within this still life composition. Traveling is represented by the camera, map, guide book and typewriter - all elements to document travel by writing and taking photographs while the map and guide book takes one to the destination. The element of time is represented in the open pocketwatch. Lighting and details are all fantastic! Well done - I love this look inside of the life of a travel writer or perhaps just an adventurer.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the lighting that puts the spotlight on revisiting memories by rediscovering things packed away in an old trunk. Unpacking memories is the idea that is strongly projected. There are vintage antique items that are perfectly arranged/placed within this still life composition. Traveling is represented by the camera, map, guide book and typewriter - all elements to document travel by writing and taking photographs while the map and guide book takes one to the destination. The element of time is represented in the open pocketwatch. Lighting and details are all fantastic! Well done - I love this look inside of the life of a travel writer or perhaps just an adventurer.', '2018-07-08 13:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578752, 1217977, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>As a Doctor Who fan I have to ask - would you like a jellybaby? ;-) Can''t miss Tom Baker''s Doctor with that distinctive scarf standing in front of the Tardis. As a fan of the show I understand the running line and joke of "it''s bigger on the inside'' but I doubt many others do. I think it might have helped to have the inside of the Tardis lit up to show the control room inside. I see that the door is slightly ajar...the control room might not be pictured inside so maybe printing it and then curling it a bit so that there is an appearance of dimension when you insert it in as the interior. Lighting, details, and composition are ....fantastic! ;-P</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. As a Doctor Who fan I have to ask - would you like a jellybaby? ;-) Can''t miss Tom Baker''s Doctor with that distinctive scarf standing in front of the Tardis. As a fan of the show I understand the running line and joke of "it''s bigger on the inside'' but I doubt many others do. I think it might have helped to have the inside of the Tardis lit up to show the control room inside. I see that the door is slightly ajar...the control room might not be pictured inside so maybe printing it and then curling it a bit so that there is an appearance of dimension when you insert it in as the interior. Lighting, details, and composition are ....fantastic! ;-P', '2018-07-08 13:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578754, 1217929, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>A view from inside a water tube - how awesome! Not a view many get to see this as an observer looking in, so kudos to you on getting this shot! The sense of fun and enjoyment is written clearly on the man''s smiling face as they are rocketing down the water tube. I would have loved to have seen the expressions on both of their faces but it still successfully captures the sense of fast moving fun at the water park from a unique perspective.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. A view from inside a water tube - how awesome! Not a view many get to see this as an observer looking in, so kudos to you on getting this shot! The sense of fun and enjoyment is written clearly on the man''s smiling face as they are rocketing down the water tube. I would have loved to have seen the expressions on both of their faces but it still successfully captures the sense of fast moving fun at the water park from a unique perspective.', '2018-07-08 13:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578758, 1217982, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Absolutely tack sharp details on the ants venturing down into the lily. The detail is stunning with all the color and sharp focus on the ants including the legs and antennae. The burst of color of orange and yellow hues also makes this photo visually pop. This is a wonderful macro view peering inside the insect world!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Absolutely tack sharp details on the ants venturing down into the lily. The detail is stunning with all the color and sharp focus on the ants including the legs and antennae. The burst of color of orange and yellow hues also makes this photo visually pop. This is a wonderful macro view peering inside the insect world!', '2018-07-08 13:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578768, 1217391, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment. <br/> <br/>Inside the Matrix there is the red pill or the blue pill. One is the way out and the other is to stay blissfully unaware of reality. I really like how you captured the glowing green data streams and the attention to detail with nods to the movie. I do have one tiny suggestion - I think the main subject needed just a tad more light on his jacket and on his arms as that his lower torso and arms are underexposed fading into the dark.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment.  Inside the Matrix there is the red pill or the blue pill. One is the way out and the other is to stay blissfully unaware of reality. I really like how you captured the glowing green data streams and the attention to detail with nods to the movie. I do have one tiny suggestion - I think the main subject needed just a tad more light on his jacket and on his arms as that his lower torso and arms are underexposed fading into the dark.', '2018-07-08 13:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578771, 1217774, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the bold red hues on the macro of this flower. Great details on the inner pistel with the white coating of pollen that rests on it.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the bold red hues on the macro of this flower. Great details on the inner pistel with the white coating of pollen that rests on it.', '2018-07-08 13:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
