(7579134, 1217657, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I love this composition''s play of ''color inside the lines''! Definitely a different and interesting take on ''inside''. The choice to make this B&amp;W was a good one for it really focuses on the subject matter, the play of contrasts and shapes &amp; patterns. A young child rides her/his scooter on the dark lines of this patterned floor. Unknown if this is a play area or outside a building with a patterned patio, but the child is already ''staying inside or on the lines''. Good eye to spot this photo opportunity!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I love this composition''s play of ''color inside the lines''! Definitely a different and interesting take on ''inside''. The choice to make this B&W was a good one for it really focuses on the subject matter, the play of contrasts and shapes & patterns. A young child rides her/his scooter on the dark lines of this patterned floor. Unknown if this is a play area or outside a building with a patterned patio, but the child is already ''staying inside or on the lines''. Good eye to spot this photo opportunity!', '2018-07-08 22:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7579138, 1217683, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment. <br/> <br/>Wonderful photo showing the man vs. nature conflict! Given the height of the soil, Nature is slowly reclaiming her space. The patterns on the sand are like waves washing in as it sweeps into the interior of the building. Great light, wonderful detail and composition!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment.  Wonderful photo showing the man vs. nature conflict! Given the height of the soil, Nature is slowly reclaiming her space. The patterns on the sand are like waves washing in as it sweeps into the interior of the building. Great light, wonderful detail and composition!', '2018-07-08 22:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7579144, 1217342, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment. <br/> <br/>I guess it is because of the blanket, beard and the surrounding environment my first thought was that of a druid of old taking shelter in a cave by the loch. Love this picturesque take on the challenge. Beautiful scenery here at the mouth of the cave! Indeed looks like a scenic place to take shelter for the night. It is chilly by the looks of things so that nice warm spot by the fire is a great place to be. The man seems to be gazing off in the distance either enjoying the view or thinking or both.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment.  I guess it is because of the blanket, beard and the surrounding environment my first thought was that of a druid of old taking shelter in a cave by the loch. Love this picturesque take on the challenge. Beautiful scenery here at the mouth of the cave! Indeed looks like a scenic place to take shelter for the night. It is chilly by the looks of things so that nice warm spot by the fire is a great place to be. The man seems to be gazing off in the distance either enjoying the view or thinking or both.', '2018-07-08 22:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7579170, 1217644, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wonderful architectural design in the interior of this building. Not just a study of shapes and patterns in the architecture, but the capture in the daily life that strolls these floors. Within the confines of this building is a slice of life as the people on the move attend to their their daily schedules.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wonderful architectural design in the interior of this building. Not just a study of shapes and patterns in the architecture, but the capture in the daily life that strolls these floors. Within the confines of this building is a slice of life as the people on the move attend to their their daily schedules.', '2018-07-08 23:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7579177, 1217966, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>A very unique perspective of being inside looking out! Inside the peanut butter jar the viewer gets a view of the person peering in as they dip their knife in to get the last scoops of peanut butter to make that perfect sandwich. Color, clarity, detail and lighting are all fantastic - well done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. A very unique perspective of being inside looking out! Inside the peanut butter jar the viewer gets a view of the person peering in as they dip their knife in to get the last scoops of peanut butter to make that perfect sandwich. Color, clarity, detail and lighting are all fantastic - well done!', '2018-07-08 23:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7579195, 1217468, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the light illuminating the interior of this instrument. The composition very definitely gives the viewer a unique view on the inside!! The light streaming through the "S" shaped holes has an eerie quality to it with the strange swirl like smoke adding visual interest. I do have one suggestion on how to make the composition even stronger in it''s presentation. If the title was not there to give the location I think it might be a bit challenging to figure it out. My suggestion is if you could either take it from a little lower angle so those ''S" shaped cut-outs are more visible or if you could angle the light streaming into those cut-outs such that the light pattern on the ''floor'' clearly shows the "S" shape than it would be easier to deduce that this is the interior of a violin.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the light illuminating the interior of this instrument. The composition very definitely gives the viewer a unique view on the inside!! The light streaming through the "S" shaped holes has an eerie quality to it with the strange swirl like smoke adding visual interest. I do have one suggestion on how to make the composition even stronger in it''s presentation. If the title was not there to give the location I think it might be a bit challenging to figure it out. My suggestion is if you could either take it from a little lower angle so those ''S" shaped cut-outs are more visible or if you could angle the light streaming into those cut-outs such that the light pattern on the ''floor'' clearly shows the "S" shape than it would be easier to deduce that this is the interior of a violin.', '2018-07-08 23:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7579217, 1217863, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>A fun and colorful composition showing the viewer the inside of cut fruit (and vegetables- red onion) in all shapes and sizes. It is a tasty variety of patterns and bursts of color. There are strawberries, grapefruit, avocado, bananas, lime, lemon, cantalope squash, tomato, pear and a nice, juicy pinea....??? Yup, a quick glance and the brain fools you into thinking one sees the inside of a pineapple but no! It is a watermelon masquerading as a pineapple. Clever twist to hide it in plain sight among all the other foods.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. A fun and colorful composition showing the viewer the inside of cut fruit (and vegetables- red onion) in all shapes and sizes. It is a tasty variety of patterns and bursts of color. There are strawberries, grapefruit, avocado, bananas, lime, lemon, cantalope squash, tomato, pear and a nice, juicy pinea....??? Yup, a quick glance and the brain fools you into thinking one sees the inside of a pineapple but no! It is a watermelon masquerading as a pineapple. Clever twist to hide it in plain sight among all the other foods.', '2018-07-08 23:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
