(7579991, 1217736, 28742, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I assumed it was so harshly processed and abstract that I wouldn''t recognize much of it. Then I read the title and it all came together. Not always a fan of this style, but this surprisingly appeals to me.</td>', 'At first glance, I assumed it was so harshly processed and abstract that I wouldn''t recognize much of it. Then I read the title and it all came together. Not always a fan of this style, but this surprisingly appeals to me.', '2018-07-10 01:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
