(7580022, 1218029, 100393, '<td valign="top">Well enough done but Im sure the title has caused some consternation.</td>', 'Well enough done but Im sure the title has caused some consternation.', '2018-07-10 04:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7580051, 1217976, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Peering inside the confines of that room shows us how packed this business is with getting their product ready. An interesting look inside the inner workings of this business! Looking forward to reading the write-up after the challenge of what this business is. One small critique - this has a candid street photography feel but when the gent in the front is turns to stare at the viewer that feel is broken. I think I see what looks like scissors in his hand as he is reaching for something in the box - to get back to the candid not posed feel it would have been great to capture a moment where he is in the action of working and using the scissors to trim or shape whatever he is getting out of the box.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Peering inside the confines of that room shows us how packed this business is with getting their product ready. An interesting look inside the inner workings of this business! Looking forward to reading the write-up after the challenge of what this business is. One small critique - this has a candid street photography feel but when the gent in the front is turns to stare at the viewer that feel is broken. I think I see what looks like scissors in his hand as he is reaching for something in the box - to get back to the candid not posed feel it would have been great to capture a moment where he is in the action of working and using the scissors to trim or shape whatever he is getting out of the box.', '2018-07-10 08:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7580053, 1217354, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great macro shot! There are alot of great tack sharp details captured here from the textures of the leaves to the legs &amp; bodies of the two spiders. Lighting on the subject is also fantastic!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great macro shot! There are alot of great tack sharp details captured here from the textures of the leaves to the legs & bodies of the two spiders. Lighting on the subject is also fantastic!', '2018-07-10 08:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
